**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      OUTPUT SUBROUTINE                                             *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE PURPOSE OF THIS SUBROUTINE IS TO TELEMETER WORD
*            PLACED IN TEMPORARY STORAGE.

* ENTRIES    OS       ENTER TO TELEMETER WORDS FROM NORMAL OPERATIONS.
*            OSLV     ENTER TO TELEMETER WORDS FROM VERIFY & PREPARE
*                     TO LOAD.

       ORG     VPLD,D.DATA
OSRT   BSS     1
WORDCT BSS     1
TAGCT  BSS     1
OSCW   BSS     1

       USE     DAT
LVCLA  CDS     LVBUF
       CLA     LVBUF
GENCLA CDS     GENBUF
       CLA     GENBUF
SENDCW ADD     D.KZRO
       PIO     000
       USE     INST

OS     STO     777          ENTER FROM NORM OP                        B
       STO     WORDCT
       CLA     GENCLA       INITIALIZE CONSTANTS AND OBTAIN           B
       STO     OSCW         CONTROL WORD                              B
       TRA     OS1

OSLV   STO     777          ENTER FROM V+P TO L                       B
       STO     WORDCT
       CLA     LVCLA        INITIALIZE CONSTANTS AND OBTAIN           B
       STO     OSCW         CONTROL WORD                              B

OS1    CLA     777
       STO     OSRT

OS2    CLA     WORDCT       ARE THERE 32 OR MORE WORDS TO TELEMETER   Q
       SUB     =(32)B20
       TMI     OS3                                                    N

       CLA     =(31)B18     SET TAG COUNTER TO MAXIMUM VALUE (31)     B
       STO     TAGCT
       TRA     OS5

OS3    CLA     WORDCT       PLACE THE NUMBER OF WORDS TO TELEMETER    B
       SHL     2
       SUB     D.KB18
       STO     TAGCT

OS4    CLA     WORDCT
       SUB     D.KB20
       TNZ     OS5          IS THIS THE LAST OR ONLY WORD TO TELEMETERQ
       CLA     D.KB21       SET A9=1 ON LAST WORD                     Y
       STO     TAGCT

OS5    CLA     OSCW
       HOP     IEDA         EXECUTE CONTROL WORD                      P
       STO     775
       CLA     SENDCW
       ADD     TAGCT
       HOP     IEDA

       HOP     OIGS         OUTPUT INTERRUPT GENERATE                 P

       CLA     WORDCT       DECREMENT WORD COUNTER                    B
       SUB     D.KB20
       STO     WORDCT

       CLA     OSCW         UPDATE CONTROL WORD                       B
       ADD     D.KB20
       STO     OSCW

       CLA     TAGCT        IS TAG COUNTER EQUAL ZERO                 Q
       AND     =(31)B18
       TNZ     OS6                                                    N

       CLA     WORDCT       IS WORD COUNTER EQUAL ZERO                Q
       TNZ     OS2                                                    N
       HOP     OSRT         EXIT HOP TO CR                            X

OS6    SUB     D.KB18       DECREMENT TAG COUNTER                     B
       STO     TAGCT
       TRA     OS4
